  "description": "This stretched beach cruiser bike combines retro design with modern durability. Featuring an oversized steel frame and single-speed setup, this chopper bike is built for style and performance. Its over-and-under dual spring classical fork and brake brake offer smooth handling and reliability, while the BMX bottom bracket and three-piece crank arms ensure strength and stability. The retro U-type cruiser handlebar (750mm x 380mm x 1.6T) and chrome alloy AFT rims (3” front, 4” rear) enhance both the bike’s look and function. The FAT white wall tires (26”x3.0 front, 26”x4.0 rear) provide excellent traction and a comfortable ride, making it perfect for cruising in style.",
